  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Pat'Enfoliz is an independent pet-sitting service based in La Garde, covering the area from Toulon to Hyères. The service was launched in early 2025 by Florian Cauvin, who holds a BEPA and a professional certificate in dog and cat breeding management, along with dog training qualified with Caniscool in 2011 and practised for several years.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you book</h2>
      <p>The services advertised on the website cover home visits one to three times a day (meals, care, cuddles), personalised walks for dogs that need to burn off energy regularly, as well as a "Peccram" introduction teaching children the right way to behave around animals. Exact prices appear on the dedicated page of the site (patenfoliz.fr/tarifs) — as with any dog sitter, it's best to talk directly with the provider before booking to confirm availability, the exact price for the chosen service, and to arrange an initial meeting with your dog.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: as with any at-home pet sitting, plan a first meeting before leaving on holiday, so your dog and their sitter get to know each other beforehand.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>La Garde sits between Toulon and Hyères, a central area for exploring the beaches of the Giens peninsula or the surrounding hills with your dog well looked after the rest of the time.</p>
